  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Can we please have a Blender Addon that directly exports to Vrchat by bypassing the use of Unity? I find that Unity is a pain to work with, trying to get custom avatars into VR chat, from constant crashes to bugs, shaders not supported or missing animation clips. There is a lot of pain that comes with this, and all users use Blender to create their custom avatars, so it would be great to have a Blender addon that can streamline it so we don't have to constantly having to export to import from Blender to Unity to debug",
